{"id":841816,"title":"13｜Cursor的Agent能力","content":"本节课介绍了使用agent模式创建并优化Python爬虫程序的过程。Agent模式不仅生成代码，还能自动安装依赖库、执行代码，并检查语法错误。通过实际演示，从科技官网的change log页面抓取信息并记录到文件中，展示了如何与agent交互以改进爬虫程序。过程中强调了agent在未明确指示下也可能自动执行任务的重要性。此外，课程还讨论了安全配置选项，如幽龙模式允许或禁止自动执行命令，以及通过白名单和黑名单管理特定命令的安全性，防止潜在风险。最后，简要预告了下一课将介绍如何在系统中集成第三方大模型。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397201,"user_name":"8000tank","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3838010,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"C5DC98A0EB57CE","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1737216801,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144128,"content":"确实，复杂逻辑处理时用angent会省心一些。但是也要注意下，因为agent会执行命令操作，咱们使用时还是要关注它的运行，如果觉得执行有问题可以及时cancel","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1737343314,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397201,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"Agent能力果然强大，虽然更耗时，但也更适合更复杂繁杂的修改","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656317,"discussion_content":"确实，复杂逻辑处理时用angent会省心一些。但是也要注意下，因为agent会执行命令操作，咱们使用时还是要关注它的运行，如果觉得执行有问题可以及时cancel","content_length":80,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1737343314,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":400404,"user_name":"°半月含雪雨","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1111119,"ip_address":"中国香港","ucode":"AD1363CCE660B0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/f4/4f/6be9c5d7.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"co